  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "A fifth house appears in the River of Time after Fang Yuan and Bing Sai Chuan press Heavenly Court’s remaining houses.",
      "chapters": [
        1694
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_river_of_time",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_bing_sai_chuan",
        "fac_heavenly_court"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Deviation (recorded): this page is filed under gu-houses because Year End Gatehouse is a named Immortal Gu House. It is mobile equipment, not a five-region map seat.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu_house"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Heavenly Court is the side shocked when the house appears in the River of Time, because that side had only four time path Immortal Gu Houses stationed there. This fifth house comes from Northern Plains and is owned by the Huang Jin tribes. Xing Ye Wang on Shark Flow Lever tries to stop it and fails. The gatehouse nears the river suppression lotus sealing formation, shines in pure white light, and a five colored light shoots out of it. From within, Five Elements Grandmaster names that light five elements profound light. The currents melt layers of the formation and open a huge hole at once. Feng Jiu Ge recognizes him as Northern Plains’ rank eight lone immortal, a formation path great grandmaster recruited by Longevity Heaven. After the move, Five Elements Grandmaster’s aura becomes extremely weak. Fang Yuan had given Longevity Heaven intel on the formation, which let the grandmaster modify five elements profound light to counter it.",
      "chapters": [
        1695
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "river-appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "path_time",
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "fac_huang_jin_bloodline",
        "char_xing_ye_wang",
        "house_shark_flow_lever",
        "char_five_elements_grandmaster",
        "char_feng_jiu_ge",
        "fac_longevity_heaven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Qing Ye on Eternal Yacht tries to chase Fang Yuan, Year End Gatehouse appears and blocks the path. An immortal formation then appears around Eternal Yacht. Qing Ye reads it as a time path formation set in a short time, and as Five Elements Grandmaster’s formation path attainment.",
      "chapters": [
        1695
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "river-appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qing_ye",
        "house_eternal_yacht"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Five Elements Grandmaster’s voice comes from within Year End Gatehouse: he cannot use the profound light a second time in that short period, and the formation has been modified so the previous light would be ineffective. He keeps controlling his immortal formation to trap Eternal Yacht.",
      "chapters": [
        1696
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "profound-light",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_five_elements_grandmaster"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan and Bing Sai Chuan, with Five Elements Grandmaster controlling Year End Gatehouse, chase Heavenly Court’s retreating houses.",
      "chapters": [
        1697
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "house-chase",
